-- title:
--   Original finite-cap Gaussian strictly stopped physical dividend reward has initial-event expectation budget
-- statement:
--   For every initial-filtration event A, prove the original finite-cap zero-jump stopped Gaussian process discounted terminal plus strict dividend cash, masked correctly at zero stopping time, has expectation on A bounded by w(x) times P(A). The original same-space finite Gaussian predictable cell martingale is conditionally centred on A; source-exact Ito/Stieltjes finite-grid discounted inequality and physical stopped limit remain the essential proof. The theorem makes the conditional-budget step tractable via the Proved initial-event-to-conditional-expectation lemma.
-- source:
--   This is the single source-exact stochastic event-budget child of Open aaf8aec2-a49b-4545-aae6-ee9cc54b884e. It directly exposes the initial-event formulation needed to use original finite-cell F0 centring 13c649df, physical L1 endpoint estimates and Proved conditional-expectation lifting 9904a1e6. No auxiliary probability spaces.

